[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m Your Task: 
[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m You don't have to read input or print anything. Your task is to complete the function sort() which sorts the elements present in the given stack. (The sorted stack is printed by the driver's code by popping the elements of the stack.)
[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m Expected Time Complexity: O(N*N)
[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m Expected Auxilliary Space: O(N) recursive.
[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m Constraints:
[36m(main_task pid=13624)[0m 1<=N<=100
